        {
          "text": "Öbhötambë bhui ichindigi chonsui inyai mbörëbha ichimiita ibhiköë kenda (9,000). Iriina riu umugi göyö gukurua bhoono na kögenderria ndëraabhe iga, ÖMÖNENE hano arë.",
